#WRITE(PTR, $00000E9E)
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000F66)
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00001044)
This... This was the first time I’d ever gotten an e-mail... from a 3D girl...
<LINE>
I gulped, then clicked to open it.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000010A4)
Yua’s usual elegance and purity shone through the e-mail. And by%Nusing a lot of emoticons, she gave it a bit of a friendly tone too.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000010B4)
But... when she said things like, “Maybe it was because Nishijou-kun was with me,” or, “I was hoping I’d be able to say hello tomorrow%Nmorning”...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000010C4)
...I just couldn’t help but feel like she was up to something.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00001112)
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000011DA)
<END>

